              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Welcome back to Celestia Base Camp! I trust you've been well since you were last here! What can I help you with?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Sirens? Oh, my. They were native to Celestia, but since the deluge they have scattered to the many Spiral seas.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Usually they are found in groups of threes (no one knows if they are sisters), and they perch atop rocks in the sea.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Together their voices create a song of such beauty it enthralls those who hear it, causing them to lose their way.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "They were once the bane of sailors, sending their ships crashing into sharp rocks or shallow shores.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "If they are summoned, the Sirens will prove powerful allies, bringing calamity and woe to your enemies!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-HUB-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I'm afraid that's all I know. Please give my regards to Professor Balestrom. I haven't seen him since college! Go Sparks!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Lady_Lower_Bowl_Hat_Purple02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LlewellaCorey_ZFA_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227311,
